1491	geniposidic acid	iridoid glycoside	The quantitatively dominant iridoid of Eucommia ulmoides bark (~0.5–1.5% dry bark in most studies); the primary HPLC authentication marker and key quality control parameter for Du Zhong (Chinese Pharmacopoeia). Anti-inflammatory (inhibits NF-κB and COX-2), hypotensive, and renal-protective in rodent models; a secoiridoid glucoside and biosynthetic precursor to genipin.	2026-08-16 17:06:36.264848+00
